{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:08.18]Lost in a dark place, lost in a dark place\n[00:15.94]Lost in a dark place\n[Verse]\n[00:21.18]Lost in a dark place, trapped in the crawlspace\n[00:25.88]In my mind, I get lost, then I wake up in a coffin\n[00:31.34]They tell me they care, they're just in love with the music\n[00:36.56]So they'll never know about the pain I go through\n[00:41.18]It's like a chain of reactions, all these demon attacks\n[00:46.30]From all the drugs that I'm taking to the women distracting me\n[00:52.18]From being myself, it's like I'm losing my traction\n[00:57.40]Kiss death on the lips, I have a fatal attraction\n[01:02.96]This is my heart, watch as my problems inspire me\n[01:08.20]Tear me apart, won't let the demons take over me\n[01:13.10]They took it too far, now I need some surgery\n[01:18.36]I'm falling apart\n[01:22.94]It's like I'm lost in the motions, use this song as a rope\n[01:28.06]To wrap around the commotion, tie the knot at my throat\n[01:33.52]I look at death as a notion, I don't want it no more\n[01:38.50]But it's too late to reverse it, as I fall on the floor\n[Outro]\n[01:49.84]Lost in a dark place, lost in a dark place\n[04:18.46]Demons inspire me\n[04:41.42]Ooh, oh","words":[[8.18,8.5,"Lost"],[8.6,8.78,"in"],[8.92,8.92,"a"],[9.16,9.62,"dark"],[9.74,10.52,"place,"],[10.78,11.12,"lost"],[11.18,11.38,"in"],[11.54,11.54,"a"],[11.76,12.26,"dark"],[12.36,13.18,"place"],[15.94,16.28,"Lost"],[16.38,16.52,"in"],[16.74,16.74,"a"],[16.96,17.48,"dark"],[17.88,18.94,"place"],[21.18,21.52,"Lost"],[21.62,21.78,"in"],[21.94,21.94,"a"],[22.2,22.68,"dark"],[22.8,23.38,"place,"],[23.78,24.16,"trapped"],[24.26,24.4,"in"],[24.52,24.58,"the"],[24.72,25.82,"crawlspace"],[25.88,25.98,"In"],[26.12,26.3,"my"],[26.44,26.78,"mind,"],[26.96,26.96,"I"],[27.12,27.3,"get"],[27.44,27.9,"lost,"],[28.08,28.42,"then"],[28.62,28.62,"I"],[28.76,29.12,"wake"],[29.18,29.4,"up"],[29.5,29.68,"in"],[29.78,29.78,"a"],[29.96,30.92,"coffin"],[31.34,31.46,"They"],[31.62,31.86,"t